+/**
+ * ppe_sr_dn_tags() - The tag inserts of an S-R download (WP2-DESIGN D8).
+ * @cls: Its class.
+ * @dn: @dn->svid, @dn->cvid and @dn->tagged are set; @dn->mtu_cap is left
+ * as it is.
+ *
